THIRD-PARTY LICENSES — RUST COMPONENTS

The following Rust crates make up Zephyr's workspace dependency
graph (desktop and mobile, all platforms), generated with cargo about
from the workspace lockfile. The graph as resolved from the lockfile
also includes test-only crates; their license texts are reproduced
here for completeness. Part A reproduces each distinct
license text gathered from the crates, including the copyright notices
it carries; several crates can share one text. Part B maps each crate to
its license(s).

